116:* ''Every Lararium holds a charter.'' One operator's charter reads as a SEED and two operators' seats in one charter read as a NEXUS (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/seed-and-nexus">>). A household seed never grows into a Nexus; a Nexus founds fresh at threshold two of two. One "I" may hold several PersonaGroups. A Nexus grows by adding seats through its own rolls.
