126:* ''CABAL names the collective, REALM holds shared resources, NEXUS names the federated hardware mesh.'' The Nexus `@crossroads` board serves public-infrastructure docs and the Kahu Cabal keeps them. An operator's offering to a book club belongs in that club's realm, signed by the face worn there.
