181:* ''One roadmap'': this carrier. Standing procedures rest at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/working-procedures">>, and the grammar watch at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/grammar-watch">>.
182:* ''The sealed store'': cleartext lives in the live wiki and the operator's projected files alone. Private bytes take randomized authenticated sealing addressed over the ciphertext; the private tier takes no convergent sealing, and no opener returns unauthenticated bytes. A content key carries a version and rolls at a causal removal act. History at admission must have stood declared when written, and one logical bag name carries its key-roll epochs (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/sealed-store">>).
